@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### Register Officer (run this first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin Officer",
  "email": "officer@placeiq.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "officer"
}

###

### Register Student
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Student",
  "email": "student@placeiq.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "student"
}

###

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "officer@placeiq.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Get Me (paste your access token below)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhMDQ4MTgyOTQyZGM4MzIwZTUzODc5OCIsInJvbGUiOiJvZmZpY2VyIiwiaWF0IjoxNzc4NjgwMTk1LCJleHAiOjE3Nzg2ODEwOTV9.ftjIEoaZZIJOgMHpEW4e4kd-tZllFZGB5nC5KHwEOGs

###

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

###

### Logout (paste your access token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
